cff-version: 1.2.0
title: SeamlessInteractions Annotation Dataset
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it using the
  metadata from this file.
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Alessandro
    family-names: Rizzo
    email: l.alessandrorizzo@gmail.com
repository-code: 'https://huggingface.co/datasets/lalessandrorizzo/seamless-interactions-annotations'
abstract: >-
  Human-annotated behavioral signal dataset for dyadic video
  interactions from the Seamless Interaction Dataset. Contains
  fine-grained multimodal annotations across 11 behavioral facets
  (98 total signals) including prosody, gaze, gesture, turn-taking,
  and more.
keywords:
  - multimodal
  - interaction
  - behavioral-signals
  - annotation
  - human-communication
  - prosody
  - gesture
  - gaze
  - turn-taking
  - video-annotation
license: CC-BY-NC-4.0
version: 1.0.0
date-released: '2026-01-11'
